<Defs>
	<ThingDef ParentName="BaseMechanoidWalker">
		<defName>APM_Mech_Lasher</defName>
		<label>Lasher</label>
		<description>Wielding a plasma charged whip, this mechanoid was originally engineered for heavy combat and destruction of enemy groups on the front lines as part of the core hive forces. However, mechanitors reconfigured its behavioral matrices to repurpose it for advanced animal handling, taming, and training. Beyond its agricultural utility, its primary combat role still utilizes this plasma whip in close-range skirmishes, allowing it to strike down foes and deal EMP damage with a chance to proc.</description>
